flowchart LR
    A[Sender Mail Server] --> B[Recipient Mail Server]
    B --> C{SPF Check}
    B --> D{DKIM Check}
    C --> E{DMARC Alignment}
    D --> E
    E --> F{DMARC Policy}
    F -->|p=none| G[Deliver and Report]
    F -->|p=quarantine| H[Quarantine or Junk]
    F -->|p=reject| I[Reject Message]
